Venus Patches NOTICE
====================

Parts of Cadence are ported from Venus Patches (https://github.com/VenusIsJaded/Venus-Patches,
Copyright VenusIsJaded and contributors, GPL-3.0), file patches/src/main/resources/venus/bootstrap.js
at commit 987b7a22d96d41a0ba80c060b485291e1c7bcc4b, which targets Discord 351.11. Cadence modified that
code to run on Discord 352.17 (module IDs, export shapes and settings were changed). Ported files say
so at the top and are listed in docs/VENUS-PORT.md with the Venus feature they come from.

Only the device indicator placements remain from the Venus feature set (the other ported features were removed):

  Cadence file                                    Venus feature                    Based on
  runtime/src/features/platformPlacements.ts      Show device indicators           PlatformIndicators

PlatformIndicators icons NOTICE
===============================

The platform icon shapes drawn in the tag chips next to message author names
(runtime/src/features/platformImage.ts) are derived from the PlatformIndicators plugin icons in
Martinz64/vendetta-plugins (https://github.com/Martinz64/vendetta-plugins, Unlicense), file
plugins/PlatformIndicators/src/StatusIcon.tsx at commit 72c4e249fb922665642450fe9c0ec9c33c7ecafa,
reduced to 48x48 alpha masks.

The method list of the "Disable telemetry and touch logging" patch
(patches/src/main/kotlin/app/cadence/patches/dex/MethodStub.kt, PrivacyStubs.telemetry) follows
Venus Patches' patches/src/main/kotlin/app/venus/patches/PrivacyPatches.kt (NativePrivacy.telemetry)
at the same commit. Cadence stubs a subset, pinned to Discord 352.17 by method digests.
